{"at":"2026-11-01T11:26:04.563Z","type":"result","sequence":3,"path":"/Users/pelicannurse/.t3/projects/first-person-shooter-soul-game/docs/media/build35-review1/brief.jpg","captureMs":108.85199999999895,"beforePause":{"phase":"dialog","dialog":"EYES ONLY // VESPER\n×\nBRING THEM HOME.\n\nThe Drowned Relay was built to preserve human memories. Last night, it began broadcasting them as a distress call.\n\nBREACH THE STATION\n\nUse the central yard and its side lanes. Concrete cover breaks a sentinel's line of sight.\n\nRECOVER THREE CORES\n\nFollow the cyan signal pylons to the waist-high memory receivers five metres in front. Approach a receiver and hold E for one second. Stay nearby while the memory is recovered. Each recovery escalates the defense response.\n\nRETURN TO EXTRACTION\n\nBring all three memories back along either lit return aisle. Upload advances only inside the grounded floor ring at the green beacon. Outside pauses briefly; reenter before decay. Face the yard, use the split baffles and watch open flanks.\n\nRed means danger. Cyan means life. Soul Shift is your way through.\n\nACCEPT BRIEFING\n↗"},"after":{"phase":"dialog","dialog":"EYES ONLY // VESPER\n×\nBRING THEM HOME.\n\nThe Drowned Relay was built to preserve human memories. Last night, it began broadcasting them as a distress call.\n\nBREACH THE STATION\n\nUse the central yard and its side lanes. Concrete cover breaks a sentinel's line of sight.\n\nRECOVER THREE CORES\n\nFollow the cyan signal pylons to the waist-high memory receivers five metres in front. Approach a receiver and hold E for one second. Stay nearby while the memory is recovered. Each recovery escalates the defense response.\n\nRETURN TO EXTRACTION\n\nBring all three memories back along either lit return aisle. Upload advances only inside the grounded floor ring at the green beacon. Outside pauses briefly; reenter before decay. Face the yard, use the split baffles and watch open flanks.\n\nRed means danger. Cyan means life. Soul Shift is your way through.\n\nACCEPT BRIEFING\n↗"},"clientMs":178.2181670000009,"pageErrors":[]}
